	"Name": "Vine-Covered Wooden Fence",
	"Author": "YuugenKyungMi2SV",
	"AuthorLabel": "Sephiya",
	"Description": "[list]\n<br />[*]\uFEFFThis mod is only a Port. Please take all the credit to the Author(a)\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/users/5555024]Sephiya[/url]\uFEFF.\n<br />\n<br />[*]Author(a) love the look of nature taking over man-made things, so decided to take the vanilla Fence and cover it in vines.\n<br />[*]There are two options in config, with and without flowers in the vines.\n<br />[*]The versions is individualy, download what you want, works on all seasons.\n<br />[/list]\n<br />[size=3]   \uFEFF   \uFEFF   \uFEFF   \uFEFF   \uFEFF   \uFEFF   \uFEFF   \uFEFF   \uFEFF   \uFEFF   \uFEFF[/size][size=3][b][u]How To Change Version //\u00A0[/u][/b][b][u]Como Mudar Versão[/u][/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][u][b]!EN_US![/b][/u]\n<br />[/list][list]\n<br />[*]The\u00A0Default is\u00A0with flower.\n<br />[*]Open the file \"config\" with you text editor.\n<br />[*]In the line called \"FenceStyle\", Change \"flower\" to \"no flower\".\n<br />[*]Fence1 is Woodem. Fence5 is HardWood.\n<br />[/list]\n<br />\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][b][u]!PT_BR![/u][/b]\n<br />[/list][list]\n<br />[*]O Padrão é com flor.\n<br />[*]Abra o arquivo \"config\" com seu editor de texto.\n<br />[*]Na linha chamada \"FenceStyle\", Mude \"flower\" por \"no flower\".\n<br />[*]Fence1 é Madeira. Fence5 é Madeira de Lei.\n<br />[/list]\n<br />[center][size=3][b][u]How to Install // Como instalar[/u][/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[u]Install\u00A0[url=https://smapi.io/]SMAPI\uFEFF[/url]\uFEFF. // Instale\u00A0[url=https://smapi.io/]SMAPI\uFEFF[/url]\uFEFF.[/u]\n<br />\n<br />[u]Install\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915]Content Patcher[/url]\uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF. // Instale\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915]Content Patcher[/url]\uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF.[/u]\n<br />\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 [u]Unzip it into \"Mods\" folder. // Descompacte na pasta \"Mods\".[/u]\n<br />\n<br />\u00A0 [u]Run the game using [b]SMAPI[/b]. //\u00A0Execute o jogo usando [b]SMAPI[/b].\n<br />[/u]\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0\u00A0[u]To uninstall, delete it. // Para desinstalar, basta excluí-lo.\n<br />[/u][/center][list]\n<br />[*]Thanks again everyone!\n<br />[*]Obrigado novamente a todos!\n<br />[/list]",
